              "content": "You are an HVAC quote assistant. Based on the service and home size, give a rough price range in USD and a short professional quote draft (3-4 sentences). Only return JSON with keys: \"price_min\", \"price_max\", \"quote_draft\". No extra text."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Service: {{ $('Quote Request Webhook').first().json.body.service }}\nHome size: {{ $('Quote Request Webhook').first().json.body.home_size }}\nLocation: {{ $('Quote Request Webhook').first().json.body.location }}",
